        {
          "text": "Forget I said it.",
          "to": "hub"
        }
      ]
    },
    "events": {
      "say": "Beer league. I play it, I flood it, I watch it. Stick and puck, if they keep the pucks out of my bay. And the Kings. Kings get the best sheet in the valley, even when they lose.",
